{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026EjTbvxlLwX1793078512.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>滙豐控股上季業績大致符合市場預期。</p><p></p><p>第三季度列帳基準稅前利潤約96億美元，按季跌半成，按年則升三成二，主要受惠銀行業務淨利息收益上升及預期信貸損失減少等。綜合首三季，稅前利潤291億美元，按年升兩成六。維持派第三次中期息，每股10美仙。</p><p></p><p>集團宣布計劃啟動最多10億美元的股份回購，預計將於2026年全年業績公布前完成。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T06:22:03.017290+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T04:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T19:18:13.098114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:18:24.418999+00:00","content_hash":"142cb9d141edc46176f0ba3f69e099cd0a4fac3a0384025de462f9640a96ece6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T06:22:03.017290+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}